#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:3
#: 5b9ce37c18c84b38b047dc3edf43db8c
msgid "严格 GSFE 路径（Strict GSFE Path）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:5
#: 73d4cf1ecee24aacb8b40fe66f5266f6
msgid "`Group`: `Defect` | `Class`: `StrictGSFEPathCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:7
#: 4cdc502bf36545db9e1f9cd22fb86230
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:9
#: 40f44594f44745a6b197ee3ce386b439
msgid ""
"按显式晶面 `hkl` 和滑移方向 `uvw` 生成未弛豫的广义层错能（GSFE）路径结构。输入必须已经是 slab-oriented "
"cell：第三晶胞方向要垂直于 `plane_hkl`，否则周期边界会把断层面错接成重合或过近原子，程序会直接报错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:11
#: 8e62921566144df9b7bef63c713b06c8
msgid ""
"相比 `Stacking Fault`，这张卡把滑移方向写成明确的晶向，并提供 "
"`middle`、`fractional`、`layer_index` 三种切面选择。它适合你已经知道目标滑移系统，想要严格控制 GSFE "
"路径几何的场景。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:13
#: 3f30c70d908e40d3ac9908faff548ee1
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:15
#: 67bc038a3c914e4b9b65abf60f887ea6
msgid "场景：模型在指定滑移系的 GSFE 峰值严重偏低"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:17
#: be42a435d0e543be83d6c1955cc98eca
msgid ""
"你在 fcc Ni 上训练了 NEP，体相和弹性响应都不错，但 (111)<112> 的 GSFE 峰值比 DFT "
"低很多。训练集里虽然有随机扰动和表面，但没有沿这个滑移系系统移动半晶体的结构，模型没学到层间错排的能量代价。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:19
#: a8aa6c3933d34ad6915f410e0ac7d675
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个 fcc111 slab-oriented 周期超胞，例如 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 的 "
"`fcc111` 原型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:21
#: d10632830e334c2aa828f402ebb99c49
msgid ""
"**目标：** 沿 slab cell 的 `(001)` 面和面内 `[100]` 周期方向生成 0 到 1 个滑移向量的路径，步长 "
"0.1；这个 `(001)` 就是原始 fcc 的 `(111)` 面。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:23
#: 56c4b01605d34e0bb021ac70e6e02804
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:24
#: ef1a6c7abbe444cd9d995aa936353a06
msgid "`plane_hkl = [0, 0, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:25
#: 627acf378104411182c2ce6d7237a752
msgid "`slip_uvw = [1, 0, 0]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:26
#: a2763274dd7040179f07bc7a92fa3047
msgid "`displacement_range = [0.0, 1.0, 0.1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:27
#: 2d6403aa873f4e52a2af554a1afe34ac
msgid "`displacement_unit = \"fraction_of_vector\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:28
#: 9091b6aed4df4f0f9754cf87e97a80d2
msgid "`cut_mode = \"middle\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:30
#: 83911295eab44747be881f53752c0d32
msgid "**输出：** 11 个未弛豫层错结构，带 `GSFE(hkl=001,uvw=100,d=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:32
#: 7fab8110670f400cb143d9524c2bd1d5
msgid ""
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 对输出结构做 DFT 单点或短弛豫后加入训练集，重训再扫同一 GSFE "
"路径。峰值、局部极小位置和曲线对称性应更接近 DFT；如果只有峰值改善但曲线仍有锯齿，把步长从 0.1 缩到 0.05。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:34
#: 28062cec71e7411c854471c1814cdf3b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:36
#: 5aa1a1cdbb094a5e8f2414512354b791
msgid "Plane HKL（plane_hkl）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:38
#: d67e289f6264438080336320578bffe2
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0, 0, 1)`。Miller 指数，定义哪一个晶面作为层错切面；该面的法向必须平行于第三晶胞方向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:40
#: 51119331faff409a82d8bc4b3ad0f345
msgid ""
"低指数面最常用：fcc111 slab cell 里用 `(001)` 表示原始 fcc `(111)` 面。`(0, 0, 0)` "
"没有物理意义，程序会直接报错。普通 cubic fcc cell 里的 `(111)` 不满足 slab-oriented 要求，不能直接使用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:42
#: b54c2390d8a14f01899c537e376f49a5
msgid "Slip UVW（slip_uvw）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:44
#: 255d98a3264f41d1b748c4407e6a5fe8
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1, 0, 0)`。晶向指数，定义滑移方向；程序会把它投影到 `plane_hkl` 所在平面内。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:46
#: 22d8b85006f949d4a4157696759c5e80
msgid ""
"如果 `slip_uvw` 平行于晶面法向，投影后长度为零，程序会报错。对于 fcc111 slab cell，先用 `[100]` "
"或另一个面内周期方向做完整周期路径；如果要扫特定 partial 位移，需要把 slab cell 的面内基矢先构造成对应路径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:48
#: fa9a31c7e6c6417298dd49f70e615cd0
msgid "Displacement Range（displacement_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:50
#: 906f1c1aa6f84f59bd688d815361bdb5
msgid "`Sequence[float]`，默认 `(0.0, 1.0, 0.5)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, 步长]`，扫描滑移位移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:52
#: 4c7492ed17274d94861839fbf5afb41b
msgid ""
"如果 `displacement_unit = \"fraction_of_vector\"`，`1.0` 表示完整投影滑移向量；如果单位是 "
"`angstrom`，数值就是 A。GSFE 曲线通常需要至少 0.05-0.1 的分辨率；只做 smoke 时可以用 0、0.5、1.0 "
"三个点快速确认几何没错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:54
#: 052a2c89074447c68e180f7fe6c45c68
msgid "Displacement Unit（displacement_unit）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:56
#: 50d343396bf747d7868a615a78bf8da4
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"fraction_of_vector\"`。决定 `displacement_range` 里的数值怎么转成真实位移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 0a6ff4dfadd44dbd973df7d28d6fda11 3c2a285834404ac88e019ba422940e7e
msgid "选项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: a629c8ef0a004553bcdb27061a7866ec eda6ecb20011455784846b59c6f2c34d
msgid "含义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 93b11598df8c402daa0a65eb2f666f71 d3687ee8c6a7494d92d2542d83ab5f3d
msgid "什么时候选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: e4450768f03d455dbce9740e7274dd69
msgid "`fraction_of_vector`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 75b2694af2fd4ff8ad69625b3077c3c5
msgid "位移 = 数值乘以投影后的 `slip_uvw` 向量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: cc22b60f01c142a780efebc0b37c0bbb
msgid "扫完整 GSFE 周期或按晶向分数描述路径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: a4134f571fb54e048fe1e68be7e12abd
msgid "`angstrom`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 408cb0561995489ba3f3ecf233416a62
msgid "位移 = 数值 A，方向为投影滑移方向的单位向量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 19ac35f89e384f4ea751348e72bf7ac2
msgid "已经知道实际位移长度，或只想小范围推开层间结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:63
#: 847dea73fd9c49b681d41a52d9e65fd0
msgid "Cut Mode（cut_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:65
#: 2722debb6d0c45409b7ff124f13ae90b
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"middle\"`。决定哪一侧原子会被整体滑移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: bcce84a3c6394d64836c35979bdb7bff
msgid "`middle`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 616b988923ec45f690ac0cac554b0155
msgid "按投影坐标中位数切开"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 07a88b2132d948a5988dc2efbb38b867
msgid "普通超胞快速生成上下两半"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 9455c0f4178a454e8e05cbe6709711b8
msgid "`fractional`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: d9e3f43172bd48139e3ac4a5ee95b2b3
msgid "按投影坐标范围的 `cut_fraction` 位置切开"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 9c824cfbbbed497da734460ab8cd31f2
msgid "想明确控制切面在胞内的相对高度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: dc604bc0214943e4a0a77bb1e3819be0
msgid "`layer_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 25654be66dec4c5c915b4f155e7bf5ee
msgid "按排序后的离散层位置切开"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 994660b94c374995a74862f785dd30c8
msgid "层状结构或 slab 中想从第几层上方开始滑移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:73
#: d07db32a09104754b8aea5b9beba273a
msgid "Cut Fraction（cut_fraction）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:75
#: 7c7e3e8f07344fcbb80183ffdad1cb7e
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.5`。当 `cut_mode = \"fractional\"` 时使用，范围是 0 到 1。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:77
#: 2e55cc26d9a641d88d3e327330bd73f1
msgid ""
"`0.5` 接近中间切面；`0.25` 会让更多原子处在上半部分并被滑移；`0.75` 则只移动靠近上侧的原子。这个值越靠近 0 或 "
"1，移动的原子数越不平衡，适合 slab 或非均匀层结构，不适合普通体相路径的第一轮扫描。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:79
#: 98c0518e89fa453f9fb1f048db1db154
msgid "生效条件：`cut_mode` 必须是 `fractional`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:81
#: a0ba2cfe9b1a4e0795bfce7144d17d37
msgid "Layer Index（layer_index）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:83
#: 3c2ae7808f4d45f2b89aa2c606a42155
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。当 `cut_mode = \"layer_index\"` 时使用，选择哪一层下面保持不动、上面的层整体滑移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:85
#: 797bdf549fa34fa59ce30fcefc512901
msgid ""
"索引从 0 开始，必须选到顶层以下的位置；如果选到最后一层，程序会报错，因为那样没有上半部分可移动。层状材料、slab "
"或你已经知道滑移面夹在哪两层之间时，用它比 `middle` 更明确。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:87
#: fac56ce5a0c145698433f6d5aa246832
msgid "生效条件：`cut_mode` 必须是 `layer_index`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:89
#: 2a665611a3b646c392ef100ee3873049
msgid "Wrap（wrap）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:91
#: 9306bf8a38c842dc9dee34977882f3cb
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后把滑移后的原子坐标包回周期晶胞内；关闭则保留真实 Cartesian 位移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:93
#: f20fe5138f4846f2b5fb554fe75d5d55
msgid ""
"训练集导出通常建议打开，避免原子跑出可视化盒子导致后续工具误判。做几何调试或想直接看半晶体移动了多远时可以关闭；关闭后输出仍然是同一个周期 "
"cell，但坐标可能超过原胞边界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:95
#: d5bfe676e2b747c4a0f18b2f1d52dd9d
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:97
#: 2d4fb19c64e144bbab6123a72f90d039
msgid "fcc111 slab 完整分数路径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:99
#: 3d93cbf44d5c401c9b5ed039e2c63fb8
