#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:162
#: 5d6d36b225ba4d0ca081775cca3d57f1
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Strict GSFE Path`：先扩胞，再切面滑移，降低小胞周期重复带来的假相互作用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:163
#: 2ba82ee930684370bc41ad4f7275e21f
msgid ""
"`Strict GSFE Path` → `Atomic "
"Perturb`：在每个位移点附近加入小扰动，让模型不仅见过理想路径，也见过热扰动后的层错环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:164
#: eb8b0d8408c147bebf189bafb2436b7d
msgid "`Bain Path` → `Strict GSFE Path`：先改变晶胞形状，再扫层错路径，用于相变或应变下的 GSFE 数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:166
#: 7493eabc6675413ab3d27261b71b019a
msgid "常见问题"
